================================================================================
LIVE-DEMO HEADS-UP (one-line config fix, not a code change)
================================================================================

- The current config.yaml pins the Groq LLM to "llama-3.3-70b-versatile", which
  Groq retired on 2026-08-16. For a live demo, flip config.yaml line 61 to
  model: "openai/gpt-oss-120b" (or the LLM falls back to the local Qwen model,
  which also works).
